        "kind": "conflict",
        "title": "Peter Dreyfuss — A Starlet in Vinewood",
        "status": "unverified",
        "text": "Conflict 1 — Source A: Grand Theft Wiki's stranger table lists Michael. Source B: GTABase, GamePressure and Grand Theft Wiki's Letter Scraps page tie it to Franklin. Difference: the protagonist who plays it Confidence in the resolution used here: 80%. This knowledge base uses Franklin."
      },
      {
        "kind": "conflict",
        "title": "Required count: 20 vs 24",
        "status": "unverified",
        "text": "Conflict 2 — Source A: GamePressure and others say 20 Strangers and Freaks missions count. Source B: GTABase's list of Franklin chains adds up to 24 missions. Difference: the number of required S&F missions Confidence in the resolution used here: 50%."
      },
      {
        "kind": "conflict",
        "title": "Barry — Grass Roots",
        "status": "unverified",
        "text": "Conflict 3 — Source A: Grand Theft Wiki: 4 of 6 Grass Roots missions are required. Source B: GTABase: the Grass Roots series (4 missions). Difference: none in the count; the mission names are listed differently Confidence in the resolution used here: 70%."
      },
      {
        "kind": "conflict",
        "title": "Rampages",
        "status": "unverified",
        "text": "Conflict 4 — Source A: Grand Theft Wiki's table assigns the Rampages to Franklin. Source B: GTA5Wiki lists them as Trevor-only (Red Mist). Difference: which protagonist plays them Confidence in the resolution used here: 40%."
      },
      {
        "kind": "conflict",
        "title": "Abigail / submarine strand",
        "status": "unverified",
        "text": "Conflict 5 — Source A: Grand Theft Wiki: Abigail's Death at Sea and What Lies Beneath are Franklin's. Source B: GamePressure: Death at Sea is Michael's and starts after buying the Sonar Collections Dock; GTA5Wiki ties the submarine pieces to an Abigail Mathers strand. Difference: protagonist and trigger Confidence in the resolution used here: 30%."
      },
      {
        "kind": "conflict",
        "title": "Hao",
        "status": "unverified",
        "text": "Conflict 6 — Source A: Grand Theft Wiki and GTABase's hobby list: Hao's street races (5 races, a hobby). Source B: GTABase's S&F list also names 'Shift Work' (1 mission) for Hao. Difference: whether Hao's content is a hobby, a stranger mission, or both Confidence in the resolution used here: 50%."
      }
